163
00:12:37.841 --> 00:12:40.301
And then he vanished.

164
00:12:41.636 --> 00:12:43.847
Impossible?

165
00:12:43.888 --> 00:12:45.932
Perhaps.

166
00:12:47.183 --> 00:12:49.978
Truth would evolve into legend

167
00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:53.398
